[{"title":"赠太史区海目先生奉使册封过里还朝之作五十四韵","author":"韩上桂","text":"绛节高衔下九霄，紫泥初布拥征轺。\n天潢派衍隆宗国，地轴根盘护圣朝。\n带砺山河盟券在，藩维畿甸赐书遥。\n斗边星泛仙槎杳，驿路春深使马骄。\n骤奉梁园誇咏雪，偶从楚客羡观潮。\n班联旧叙王人重，宴洽新承帝子招。\n绶结银黄荣过里，途迎冠盖快题桥。\n玉堂秘地清仍切，阆苑仙香远自飘。\n盛德久占容驷入，贵游争慕阿龙超。\n经传家学承裘冶，宠藉君恩湛蓼萧。\n露下金茎天泽渥，书雠藜阁夜光摇。\n翠屏春度莺花暖，宝篆烟微兽炭烧。\n族会琳琅纷错耀，阶连兰桂挺森条。\n秦廷白简群簪笔，王氏青箱尽珥貂。\n雏振奇毛原鷟鸑，驹名汗血本骅骝。\n一门子弟俱能赋，满座埙篪可并调。\n盛世图书呈上瑞，清时球训重明瑶。\n彤霞日下抒灵彩，琪树风前揽秀标。\n独唱阳春裁郢曲，登歌肆夏叶虞韶。\n泗滨远戛浮金磬，嶰谷重翻引凤箫。\n习汰梁陈澄靡丽，力回汉魏振风谣。\n斲轮妙技惊成鐻，破的微言薄射雕。\n怪似骊渊探象罔，奇从鲛室裂冰绡。\n五都宝集材云富，三峡泉倾思转饶。\n誉重龙门飞瀑注，望隆泰岳俯岧峣。\n垂云广振南溟翼，悬曜同瞻北斗杓。\n自叹崎岖齐蹇驽，却怜栖息拟鹪鹩。\n牢骚但可凭诗遣，磊块惟堪借酒浇。\n笛溯流风喧晚牧，歌当落日引归樵。\n眠缘懒读空便腹，病值愁吟几瘦腰。\n谬享千金存敝帚，虚乘五石泛轻瓢。\n情怀楮叶劳摹刻，技习虫鱼好篆雕。\n奈愧效颦矜里丑，祇应焚砚似君苗。\n仰看霞彩惭幽缬，静听鸾音怯沸蜩。\n感籁鸣从春蚓动，望洋笑比井蛙跳。\n牺文肯弃沟中断，桐韵须携爨下焦。\n海燕力微思附汉，谷莺声远欲迁乔。\n风摇弱卉轻犹拂，雪入鸿垆点旋销。\n幸托通家连孔李，喜承虚问采刍荛。\n高轩绣毂频相过，绮席金尊数见邀。\n下榻旧联鸣雨夕，分题同对落花朝。\n閒随楚泽依兰幄，并泛湘流奉桂桡。\n颇似辟支闻大乘，将因洛诵契参寥。\n指麾群队从前帜，荡斥纤尘佐末飙。\n四牡未应淹骥足，双旌期尔遄星镳。\n已瞻衣锦行清昼，还听鸣珂赴早宵。\n道并作霖踪傅说，德誇迈种媲皋陶。\n在公夙夜勤三事，退食从容表庶僚。\n体袭柏梁赓汉武，颂同华祝赞唐尧。\n皓容振鹭波间浴，劲节贞松雪后凋。\n有道相臣谐玉烛，太平天子问庭燎。\n勋名鼎鼐供镌勒，图象丹青入画描。\n奉使皇华劳讽谕，作人云汉俨光昭。\n蓬莱缥缈如相忆，金阙银宫首重翘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23355,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠督学朱金岳公二十韵","author":"韩上桂","text":"奎壁文章秘府开，轩輶使节赤霄来。\n河图负瑞归东序，昆琬腾辉映上台。\n望切斗山悬仰止，光摇云汉倬昭回。\n书藏禹穴今从探，赋拟霞标昔并裁。\n三秀芝颜芬郁郁，九苞鸾彩美毰毸。\n关西伯起综髦誉，冀北孙阳揽骏材。\n夜雨屡沾岩下桂，春风先发岭头梅。\n冲牛宝剑拭龙匣，照乘明珠剖蚌胎。\n水镜澄瑩祛夙障，玉壶皎洁绝纤埃。\n提衡万象低昂见，顿网弥天钜细该。\n化入鸿垆销点雪，鸣从幽蛰试惊雷。\n孔铃再振蒙情觉，邹笛频吹淑气催。\n绪接遗文寻未坠，力扶大雅挽将颓。\n七盘险磴康庄出，百折狂澜砥柱回。\n漫刺祇凭诗作介，握芳希托凤为媒。\n环观璧沼欢含藻，思御龙门叹曝腮。\n就笼参苓供药物，倚墙桃李借栽培。\n雕虫颇售铅刀割，绣虎宁辞袜线才。\n誉窃片言轻鼎吕，价期一顾重驽骀。\n作人倘附菁莪化，愿效南山歌有台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23356,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠张九岳秘书","author":"韩上桂","text":"银箭轻浮漏转沉，铜龙旦启地仍深。\n云移五色迎天仗，柳拂千条锁禁林。\n暖日彤墀辉鹭序，晴霄丹诏下鸾音。\n三朝故实劳询访，一代丝纶费讨寻。\n鸡树清辉人共羡，凤池秘远念常钦。\n自知金马能谐世，岂谓雕龙更苦心。\n汗血久推腾逸足，彩毛今拟映仙禽。\n珍同昆圃言言玉，价重荆杨字字金。\n坟诵便堪誇倚相，檄成何必让陈琳。\n奇文似绮应频制，大笔如椽可独任。\n寡和几人酬郢雪，赓歌此日叶虞琴。\n潘舆御后情能赋，沈带移来性喜吟。\n翠管讵从仙颖授，金茎翻向露华斟。\n不须羽猎誇胡骑，愿效千秋献宝箴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23357,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"出匣中剑弹示李九倩","author":"韩上桂","text":"一别荆轲去，匣尘埋至今。\n为君重拂拭，飋飋动龙吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23358,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠霍从先","author":"韩上桂","text":"宝匣青萍剑，霜蹄白鼻騧。\n行行日欲暮，前路鲁朱家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23359,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"从军词 其一","author":"韩上桂","text":"朔风劲于箭，朔草枯如漆。\n万里度居延，尅胜在明日。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23360,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"从军词 其二","author":"韩上桂","text":"愿以灶下养，敌彼左贤王。\n蛇矛轻战斗，龙剑厉光铓。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23361,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"从军词 其三","author":"韩上桂","text":"猎猎云旗拥，萧萧边马鸣。\n临洮三万里，大半受降城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23362,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"塞上曲 其一","author":"韩上桂","text":"风劲胡胶折，霜深虏骑迷。\n向来长技尽，不敢到辽西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23363,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"塞上曲 其二","author":"韩上桂","text":"乌声今夜乐，知是虏空营。\n急度临河马，先收蓟北城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23364,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠庄将军 其一","author":"韩上桂","text":"满月须防战，鸣飙急据鞍。\n旄头今夜落，直欲斩楼兰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23365,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠庄将军 其二","author":"韩上桂","text":"万里逢归戍，还家未有期。\n自从受诏日，薄命拚如丝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23366,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠庄将军 其三","author":"韩上桂","text":"平生凭燕颔，今日扫龙庭。\n汉皇甚神武，大将亦威灵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23367,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闺思 其一","author":"韩上桂","text":"谯鼓喧相迫，灯残梦不成。\n岂宜空枕上，犹复妒寒更。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23368,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闺思 其二","author":"韩上桂","text":"为报津前妇，休贪江上鱼。\n鱼来空比目，不见一行书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23369,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日王氏庄","author":"韩上桂","text":"水石会幽趣，云林淡息机。\n雏莺涩不啭，乳燕学翻飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23370,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"访张道人不遇","author":"韩上桂","text":"木落侵纡径，天寒早闭关。\n丹崖层万仞，可望不可攀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23371,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠水云丈人","author":"韩上桂","text":"丈人失姓字，家世混渔樵。\n雨后投竿饵，归山种药苗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23372,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠郑云谷","author":"韩上桂","text":"主人鸡黍约，客子龙唇弹。\n曲罢馀鲛泪，深深溅玉盘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23373,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题云溪别业","author":"韩上桂","text":"新栽竹槛嫩寒枝，旧合松门擘翠皮。\n柳条密结藏莺偶，荷叶开斜见鹭丝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23374,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"漫兴","author":"韩上桂","text":"翠袖飘摇翳弱兰，玉盘饱饭青琅玕。\n京南京北不称意，匹马欲还春雨寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23375,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"访夏处士不遇","author":"韩上桂","text":"石楼丹削倚山椒，架壑枯杨不用桥。\n门外寒云生冉冉，知君去斸黄精苗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23376,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"征东歌 其一","author":"韩上桂","text":"我皇六月东出师，黑云高捲羽林旗。\n维舟瀛海三山石，系马扶桑万仞枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23377,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"征东歌 其二","author":"韩上桂","text":"乐浪东郡枕相连，万里金瓯护汉边。\n圣主恩深劳问罪，此行本为固朝鲜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23378,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"征东歌 其三","author":"韩上桂","text":"大将横行海上头，摐金伐鼓耀神州。\n甲环蓬岛高相并，马饮东溟竭不流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23379,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"征东歌 其五","author":"韩上桂","text":"猛士投鞭截海流，临行笑赠拭吴钩。\n曩时已断天骄臂，此日还悬日本头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23380,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"征东歌 其八","author":"韩上桂","text":"前旌鸟隼竞飞扬，后阵龙蛇势莫当。\n精卫亦知衔木石，鼋鼍今拟驾桥梁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23381,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"征东歌 其九","author":"韩上桂","text":"万里长驱出汉关，扫清岛屿始应还。\n戮取鲸鲵为巨观，别开楼阁傍神山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23382,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"征东歌 其十","author":"韩上桂","text":"鹢首朝惊水怪频，三山宫阙总如银。\n系来男女知多少，犹是当年采药人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23383,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游天坛 其一","author":"韩上桂","text":"苍松夹道昼阴森，丹洞长封野草深。\n山鸟似将歌吹啭，翩翻犹待翠华临。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23384,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游天坛 其二","author":"韩上桂","text":"星旗缥缈映仙幡，万朵彤云捧至尊。\n见说銮舆初御日，亲劳法从驻龙轩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23385,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠贞斋鍊师","author":"韩上桂","text":"彤云隐隐护灵坛，古柏萧森夏亦寒。\n丹臼烟迷苔欲染，空悬玉杵捣琅玕。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23386,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠玉泉小道士","author":"韩上桂","text":"芙蓉结作切云冠，北斗光悬剑气寒。\n吹罢玉箫人不见，独携宝箓驾仙鸾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23387,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠谢少安 其一","author":"韩上桂","text":"长安宝骑竞繁华，日夜经过七贵家。\n见说名园春正满，招携同看牡丹花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23388,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠谢少安 其二","author":"韩上桂","text":"匹马垂杨度玉鞍，独携宝剑照霜寒。\n道旁年少休相问，不是专诸不借看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23389,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠康庄马太史游浮丘诗 其一","author":"韩上桂","text":"高望丹霞兮似绚，薰风穆如兮轻扇。\n引绛节兮徘徊，想仙人兮隐见。\n丘之北兮散平畴，丘之南兮俯壑流。\n惟丹井兮安在，将炼灶兮来求。\n太史观风兮远举，翩独适兮谁侣。\n问洞庭兮潇湘，溯三江兮沅渚。\n踰岭兮逍遥，倚风流兮激洞箫。\n索梅花于檐角，探丛桂于山椒。\n将浮丘之足耦，岂葛洪之果遥。\n若有人兮校天禄，藜光夜夜兮烂龙烛。\n通姓字兮金闺，嚼紫芝兮漱寒玉。\n椿既扬兮荆亦荣，挹茎露兮步蓬瀛。\n纵奇观兮天外，控鹤辔兮云軿。\n信幽兰兮味合，呼众凤兮嘤鸣。\n桂醑兮兰杓，藉芳茵兮腾羽爵。\n妙藻兮玄文，清词兮善谑。\n映丽锦于花光，寄灵思于丹阁。\n曲水兮觞浮，兰亭嗣兮风流。\n伟仙槎之骤至，足胜事乎千秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23390,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠康庄马太史游浮丘诗 其二","author":"韩上桂","text":"仙人绛节霞为冠，盖拥芙蓉控紫鸾。\n言经五岭维珠浦，更访浮丘觅圣丹。\n丹山玄圃知非远，振衣原自蓬莱苑。\n旧人银宫气倍寒，今来炎徼风常暖。\n万里山河寓目存，千年洞壑从君选。\n似此幽奇世外宽，玉堂佳客每盘桓。\n瀔阳逸事光鸿业，太史新篇壮大观。\n入夏轻霞封野荔，木绵古木浓阴蔽。\n一笑豪情宇宙空，凉风习习生衣袂。\n君是天朝之贵臣，向日丹忱在捧纶。\n东南民力看将竭，一滴应沾雨露匀。\n岭海即今增胜概，藻雅风流追往代。\n若过南岳问祝融，两地烟霞谁是最。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23391,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠康庄马太史游浮丘诗 其三","author":"韩上桂","text":"畴昔之夕兮綵云结空，有美一人兮蔚若龙从。\n来游南海兮憩于瑶宫，彼浮丘之何代兮于谁而逢。\n吹笙玄圃兮驾鹤溟濛，遗丹井于千祀兮洒往韵于清风。\n日月推迁兮竟不相待，唯至术之能垂兮与金石而终配。\n葛子去兮不还，浮丘杳兮难攀。\n咽清泉于涧底，倚丛桂于山间。\n山间兮岁晏，古字苍苔兮漫漶。\n旧渔歌兮唱酬，今石帆兮讵泛。\n美人之来自南阳，手携玉节凌云翔。\n佩声远出催寒溜，身到蓬莱万树香。\n岭峤久不闻仙韵，丹崖深闭谁能问。\n月照寒潭一色清，风吹万籁千岩振。\n似此逸度兮可谁同，金茎挹兮玉露浓。\n望皇华兮照烨，揽琪树兮青葱。\n灵心未歇兮倡兹奇会，手握崇兰兮杂以芳蕙。\n锦之错兮霞明，凤之翩兮日丽。\n碧射玉盘兮角菱，红压瑶枝兮粟荔。\n芬苾郁兮透绮疏，丹灼烁兮留岩砌。\n维薰风之自南兮，时披拂于衣袂。\n浮丘兮恍来，风流兮倘继。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23392,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠康庄马太史游浮丘诗 其四","author":"韩上桂","text":"首夏烨炎景，薰风扇南岭。\n云翩绛节来，霓动晨旌整。\n仙人自玉堂，雅意探玄冥。\n言宣圣世纶，六辔皇华骋。\n芝盖下羊城，缅邈寻丹井。\n葛翁不可求，虚自悬灵境。\n郁郁桂香浮，夜月摇清影。\n猛然发深思，幽芳令人省。\n愿邀鸾鹤俦，直造玄云顶。\n羽觞纷献酬，野色淡孤暝。\n分题像物工，妙诀谁能领。\n邂逅几何时，虬辔宵中警。\n千秋逸事传，胜与兰亭永。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23393,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠康庄马太史游浮丘诗 其五","author":"韩上桂","text":"仙杖引青藜，清光望不迷。\n来从绛阙北，憩此浮丘西。\n异响聆朱凤，初晴见赤霓。\n登龙欢未晚，犹得奉扳跻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23394,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠康庄马太史游浮丘诗 其六","author":"韩上桂","text":"宿雨压枝头，薰风晚更柔。\n香从阆苑拂，彩借卿云浮。\n逸语霏玄屑，清情湛碧流。\n烟霞一片石，千载待冥搜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23395,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠康庄马太史游浮丘诗 其七","author":"韩上桂","text":"浮丘门户本罗浮，海上仙翁一再游。\n藜杖俨从天外至，星槎真见汉边留。\n苔封古字谁能读，云护丹崖尚可求。\n访胜几何逢弭节，新篇犹许万人酬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23396,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠康庄马太史游浮丘诗 其八","author":"韩上桂","text":"贤相瀔阳旧有名，搜来奇胜拟蓬瀛。\n蓁芜久叹山灵寂，吟望今看景色明。\n霞泛曲岑芝欲绚，风含幽壑桂犹荣。\n侍臣素沐金门宠，双掌应思玉露盈。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23397,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"社集听笙亭","author":"韩上桂","text":"三山原不远，碧海旧相寻。\n地接流云气，人怀出世心。\n看棋柯欲烂，对酒陆堪沉。\n向夕迎仙吹，如闻鸾凤音。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23398,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"浮丘社寿桐柏山人","author":"韩上桂","text":"会文还此地，起草竞探玄。\n已与嚣尘隔，偏宜爽气连。\n江涛驱入砚，桃实掇登筵。\n醉后凌丹巘，飘飘步欲仙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23399,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋得浮丘石","author":"韩上桂","text":"篙痕看尚在，舟去已何之。\n任是沧桑变，丹丘故不移。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23400,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"珊瑚井","author":"韩上桂","text":"石鏬写清泉，云透南溟底。\n一掬醒心魂，观涛徒为尔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23401,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"环瀛台","author":"韩上桂","text":"高台■绝岛，面面俯清流。\n不逐灵槎去，那从犯半牛。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23402,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"御风亭","author":"韩上桂","text":"水际跨长虹，一亭俨孤峙。\n放袂此中行，飘飘何所止。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23403,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"听笙亭","author":"韩上桂","text":"缑山曾一弄，仙响更寥寥。\n到此聆清吹，重瞻鹤羽飘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23404,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挹袖轩","author":"韩上桂","text":"广袖似云屯，乘风游无际。\n挹之将何从，逍遥靡所系。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23405,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"三仙祠","author":"韩上桂","text":"浮丘去不还，稚川时至止。\n卖药者韩康，迄今长孙子。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23406,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赵文敏公祠","author":"韩上桂","text":"灵山存旧谶，五百是兴辰。\n今日遭殊劫，方思选胜人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23407,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送刘乾阳老师入贺咏花诗册荷花","author":"韩上桂","text":"太乙仙舟溯月明，独携绛节向神京。\n云间翠盖遥相接，挹赐金茎羽翼生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23408,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"紫薇","author":"韩上桂","text":"画省曾闻借美名，轻枝缥缈压繁英。\n君行试指天台路，万朵红霞护赤城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23409,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杨梅","author":"韩上桂","text":"杨家奇果几能知，岭峤人言胜荔枝。\n玉盘满饤琼英灼，赠尔还将鼎实期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23410,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"玉兰","author":"韩上桂","text":"玉树瑩然倚谢庭，晓来风暖吐奇馨。\n美人纫结同湘浦，坠露犹堪倒玉瓶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23411,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杮","author":"韩上桂","text":"雪里枝头珍果熟，雕檐点缀辉红玉。\n病肺何愁渴未消，一咽灵浆知满腹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23412,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"栗","author":"韩上桂","text":"异种曾闻植上林，携来蒸玉胜南金。\n趋朝此日天颜近，战栗真堪报赤心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23413,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送罗象之公祖入觐诗荔枝 其一","author":"韩上桂","text":"搴帷时见火云奇，万斛丹砂压翠枝。\n圣主恩深饶雨露，金茎应向日华披。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23414,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送罗象之公祖入觐诗荔枝 其二","author":"韩上桂","text":"日南珍树带轻霞，绿叶丛生裹绛纱。\n道是行春看入夏，转疑嘉实是名花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23415,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"芙蓉 其一","author":"韩上桂","text":"清水芙蓉迥绝尘，岂知木末竞奇新。\n秋霜两岸谁能拒，露冕经行处处春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23416,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"芙蓉 其二","author":"韩上桂","text":"秀色云中似可餐，金章紫绶映雕鞍。\n君恩好是承朝日，况有微醺却耐寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23417,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]